  "version": "0.4.1",
  "title": "Cast to cluster",
  "description": "Plays a stream URL from your phone on the instrument cluster, the HUD or the media console, with its sound through the speakers: scan the QR code, paste a URL, pick where it goes. With hook111 armed, also CarPlay's own second screen (its cluster map) on the cluster or the HUD. Controlled by touch on the central screen too, parked or driving, where mgu-render is installed",
